      "name": "TST_Betterment_AP_Agent_v2",
      "description": "TST draft (CLI-6275). Processes one Zip invoice: classifies the item, selects exactly one PO for a PO-backed invoice, prepares the bill, checks the hard rules and the confidence gate, and posts a proposal or a hand-off to Slack. Non-PO invoices go to a separate queue without coding. Mock PO data until the Zip key arrives. Design: sol-betterment invoice-processing/p1-discovery/ap-agent-scope-and-design.html.",
